      "basis": "PRP-D01 PRP-D02 PRP-D03 PRP-D04",
      "meaning": "The resume has independent identity and editable content. Source selection describes provenance; it is not permission to read a changed source value automatically. Override values belong to the intended resume. The diagram does not prescribe copying, normalization or event storage.",
      "bounds": "P uses the Q-D06 single-profile/multiple-resume proposal. Zero selection/override rows allow an incomplete draft in the working model. Entry/selection identity and exact granularity remain proposed. Accepted Q-D07 rules prohibit automatic draft/live changes and protect independent content regardless of representation."
    },
