      "basis": "PRP-D05 PRP-D06 PRP-D07 PRP-D09",
      "meaning": "Evidence existence, professional association and per-resume disclosure are separate information. Content can be text, a permitted file or a link; no file is mandatory for every evidence item. Each language value belongs to a clearly identified content context rather than a global translation record.",
      "bounds": "P follows Q-D08/Q-D09. Several supporting associations and per-resume inclusion/order are proposed. Language-owning context is exclusive per value: the two context lines are alternatives, not a requirement to belong to both entry and resume. Their exact counts are intentionally unspecified. Missing wording/artifact is never fabricated."
